# Dockerfile-specific ignore for the ENGINE agent build (BuildKit prefers
# <dockerfile>.dockerignore over the repo-root .dockerignore). The root
# .dockerignore excludes `engine` because it targets the design-agent image;
# the engine agent image NEEDS engine/, so this file keeps it and drops the
# design-agent-only exclusion. Excludes only what the engine image never uses.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/*.tsbuildinfo
.git
apps/web
packages/design-agent
packages/agent
packages/ai
**/.env.local
*.log
.DS_Store
